        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "哪里的比赛？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "英国的，英超。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么都是英国的？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "英国的比赛好看啊！",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "这是白天吗？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "是啊，我说过如果太阳在头顶就是当地中午12点。现在我们是晚上，欧洲是白天。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "他们是多少点？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:008",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我看一下。伦敦是14点。我们是晚上9点，他们是14点。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-08-29-what-time-is-it-in-london_dialogue_008_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "008",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        }
